{"name":"Copperfield","hex":"#da8a88","fetched":"2026-10-12","looked":{"definitions":[{"term":"Copperfield","whole":true,"parts":[{"part":"Proper noun","definitions":["A surname."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/Copperfield"}],"entries":[{"title":"Clermont, Queensland","blocks":[{"text":"Clermont is a rural town and locality in the Isaac Region, Queensland, Australia. Clermont is a major hub for the large coal mines in the region, and is also a service town for agricultural properties in the area. In the 2021 census, the locality of Clermont had a population of 2,952 people."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/c/ca/Clermont-flood-memorial-outback-queensland-australia.jpg/330px-Clermont-flood-memorial-outback-queensland-australia.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Clermont%2C_Queensland"},{"title":"Copperfield (musical)","blocks":[{"text":"Copperfield is a 1981 musical with a book, music, and lyrics by Al Kasha and Joel Hirschhorn, who were nominated for the 1981 Tony Award for Best Original Score. It is based on the classic 1850 novel David Copperfield by Charles Dickens."}],"link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Copperfield_(musical)"}],"images":[{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/0/07/StateLibQld_2_51740_Students_at_the_Clermont_State_School%2C_Queensland%2C_ca._1905.jpg/500px-StateLibQld_2_51740_Students_at_the_Clermont_State_School%2C_Queensland%2C_ca._1905.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/0/07/StateLibQld_2_51740_Students_at_the_Clermont_State_School%2C_Queensland%2C_ca._1905.jpg/500px-StateLibQld_2_51740_Students_at_the_Clermont_State_School%2C_Queensland%2C_ca._1905.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"Clermont State School, circa 1905","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/F